<title>HONG KONG: IDT Int'l year net jumps 360.5 percent.</title>
<headline>IDT Int'l year net jumps 360.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  49.1	vs 11.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   6.0	 vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 64.5 gain vs 8.8 loss</p>
<p>    Net			   138.6     vs 30.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		    1,148.2   vs 1,014.5</p>
<p>    Company name		IDT International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 August 25-28</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  October 7</p>
<p>NOTE - IDT International makes electronic products.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$63.3 million on disposal and deemed disposal of 25 percent interest in a subsidiary arising as a result of the listing of shares in the subsidiary on the Stock Exchange of Singapore Ltd and gain of HK$1.2 million on disposal of property.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 14.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 2.5 cents and speical interim dividend of six cents) vs six cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
